SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-3.0-or-later

NazoOS default firewall zone (ADR 0021), modelled on Fedora's
"FedoraWorkstation" zone. Below port 1025 only the listed services are
reachable: system services that are switched on by accident stay
closed. Ports 1025-65535 are open: games, Steam Remote Play, KDE
Connect and voice chat work without asking. ssh and samba only answer
when the user switches them on (nazoos-welcome, Dolphin share).
The kiwi config.sh makes this the default zone.
-->
<zone>
  <short>NazoOS</short>
  <description>Gaming desktop: incoming connections below port 1025 are rejected except for the listed services. Ports 1025 and above are open for games, game streaming and desktop apps.</description>
  <service name="dhcpv6-client"/>
  <service name="mdns"/>
  <service name="samba-client"/>
  <service name="samba"/>
  <service name="ssh"/>
  <port protocol="udp" port="1025-65535"/>
  <port protocol="tcp" port="1025-65535"/>
  <forward/>
</zone>
